<p style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6B6B80;">Questions? <a href="mailto:support@nexdo.test" style="color:#2F6BFF;text-decoration:underline;">support@nexdo.test</a></p>
