us:14px;background:#FCE7F7;color:#D819B5;font-size:28px;text-align:center;">✦</div><h3 style="margin:10px 0 5px;font-size:15px;line-height:21px;color:#0B0B2E;">Get AI support</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6B6B80;">Break down tasks and find next steps</p></td></tr></table></div></div>
